            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Vitality &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Deep Root</p><p><em>Dense, cool, and very slightly translucent. It is thicker over the organs.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>+1 item bonus to Fortitude saves.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Resistance 5</strong> to poison. You are immune to disease.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Once per day, when you roll a success on a Fortitude save, get a <strong>critical success</strong> instead.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Once per <strong>round</strong> instead of once per day. You cannot be <strong>drained</strong> or <strong>enfeebled</strong>.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
